<speak>It's easy to carry the office habit into ordinary family time without noticing. A walk doesn't always need to be combined with three other stops. At least you can see which parts of the new routine you enjoy. For our housekeeping discussion, we can take the same straightforward approach: one place for messages, one familiar way of saving documents, and a clear route for asking about an administrative issue. We needn't make your personal filing system overly elaborate.</speak>